  "item_short_desc": "<p>Built for comfort and designed to elevate your outdoor experience with Rothco's Camo Pullover Hooded Sweatshirt. The hoodie is the perfect combination of ruggedness, comfort, and style. With an ultra-soft fleece interior and cotton/poly blend, you will never want to take this hoodie off.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
