  "description": "<p>Built for comfort and designed to elevate your outdoor experience with Rothco's Camo Pullover Hooded Sweatshirt. The hoodie is the perfect combination of ruggedness, comfort, and style. With an ultra-soft fleece interior and cotton/poly blend you will never want to take this hoodie off. Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over seven decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and active-duty personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>",
